        "note": "The reference article confirms that L-8 crashed in the street in front of a house on Bellevue Avenue in Daly City on August 16, 1942.",
        "correction": null
      },
      {
        "claim": "The two crew members, Lieutenant Ernest Dewitt Cody and Ensign Charles Ellis Adams, were missing.",
        "verdict": "SUPPORTED",
